{"id":"1d5f212f0e342114","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure.md","title":"SLDNF 的抽象成功与失败最小闭包","display":"df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure — SLDNF 的抽象成功与失败最小闭包","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure","aliases":["72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure"],"display":"df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure — SLDNF 的抽象成功与失败最小闭包","depends_on":["[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX Definition5.1.3, print663/PDF675","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"all five source clauses and least-closed-pair construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"把正原子集合定义放入 Assertion 并对接 PosAt 精确来源"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure — SLDNF 的抽象成功与失败最小闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX Definition5.1.3, print663/PDF675"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"all five source clauses and least-closed-pair construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"把正原子集合定义放入 Assertion 并对接 PosAt 精确来源"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是正规程序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G=\\mathsf{Goal}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal G=\\mathsf{Goal}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A^+\">\\(\\mathcal A^+\\)</span> 将在下式取既有正关系原子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-A\">\\(-A\\)</span> 在本文件缩写对应的负字面量。</li>\n<li>下式的 U,V 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal G\\)</span>，A、B 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A^+\">\\(\\mathcal A^+\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClNF}_P(Y,N)\">\\(\\operatorname{ClNF}_P(Y,N)\\)</span> 的 Y、N 都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal G\\)</span> 的子集。所有量词属于元语言，未用有限阶段假定来处理无限前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A^+:=\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A^+:=\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ClNF}_P(Y,N)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;\\langle\\rangle\\in Y\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U,V,A\\ \\forall\\langle B,K\\rangle\\in P\\ \\forall\\sigma\\\n\\bigl[A=B\\sigma\\land U^\\frown(K\\sigma)^\\frown V\\in Y\\Rightarrow U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in Y\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\langle A_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k}\\in(\\mathcal A^+)^k\\\n\\bigl[(\\forall i&lt;k\\ \\langle A_i\\rangle\\in N)\\Rightarrow\\langle-A_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k}\\in Y\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U,V,A\\\n\\left[\\left(\\forall\\langle B,K\\rangle\\in P\\ \\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\\n(A\\sigma=B\\tau\\Rightarrow (U\\sigma)^\\frown(K\\tau)^\\frown(V\\sigma)\\in N)\\right)\n\\Rightarrow U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in N\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U,V,A\\ (\\langle A\\rangle\\in Y\\Rightarrow U^\\frown\\langle-A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in N),\\\\\n\\mathcal C_P&amp;:=\\{\\langle Y,N\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal G)^2:\\operatorname{ClNF}_P(Y,N)\\},\\\\\nY_P&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{Y:\\exists N\\ \\langle Y,N\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_P\\},\\qquad\nN_P:=\\bigcap\\{N:\\exists Y\\ \\langle Y,N\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_P\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ClNF}_P(Y,N)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;\\langle\\rangle\\in Y\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U,V,A\\ \\forall\\langle B,K\\rangle\\in P\\ \\forall\\sigma\\\n\\bigl[A=B\\sigma\\land U^\\frown(K\\sigma)^\\frown V\\in Y\\Rightarrow U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in Y\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\langle A_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k}\\in(\\mathcal A^+)^k\\\n\\bigl[(\\forall i&lt;k\\ \\langle A_i\\rangle\\in N)\\Rightarrow\\langle-A_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k}\\in Y\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U,V,A\\\n\\left[\\left(\\forall\\langle B,K\\rangle\\in P\\ \\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\\n(A\\sigma=B\\tau\\Rightarrow (U\\sigma)^\\frown(K\\tau)^\\frown(V\\sigma)\\in N)\\right)\n\\Rightarrow U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in N\\right]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U,V,A\\ (\\langle A\\rangle\\in Y\\Rightarrow U^\\frown\\langle-A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in N),\\\\\n\\mathcal C_P&amp;:=\\{\\langle Y,N\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal G)^2:\\operatorname{ClNF}_P(Y,N)\\},\\\\\nY_P&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{Y:\\exists N\\ \\langle Y,N\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_P\\},\\qquad\nN_P:=\\bigcap\\{N:\\exists Y\\ \\langle Y,N\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_P\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐条对应 Y0、Y1、Y2、N1、N2。顶对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G)\">\\((\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G)\\)</span> 封闭，故交集族非空；若规则全部前提在分量交内，就在每个封闭对内，因此结论也在每个对内，证明交仍封闭且最小。N1 可以有无限多个代入前提，不能未经证明将最小闭包改写成 ω 个有限推导阶段。此处的 Y、N 不自动等于操作定义 R(P)、F(P)，原书紧随其后已给出不等价的例子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$ 是正规程序，$\\mathcal G=\\mathsf{Goal}_\\Sigma$。代入取 [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]；$\\mathcal A^+$ 将在下式取既有正关系原子集 $\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma$；$-A$ 在本文件缩写对应的负字面量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G=\\mathsf{Goal}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"-A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"A_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ClNF}_P(Y,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A^+:=\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ClNF}_P(Y,N)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&\\langle\\rangle\\in Y\\\\\n&\\land\\forall U,V,A\\ \\forall\\langle B,K\\rangle\\in P\\ \\forall\\sigma\\\n\\bigl[A=B\\sigma\\land U^\\frown(K\\sigma)^\\frown V\\in Y\\Rightarrow U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in Y\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\langle A_i\\rangle_{i<k}\\in(\\mathcal A^+)^k\\\n\\bigl[(\\forall i<k\\ \\langle A_i\\rangle\\in N)\\Rightarrow\\langle-A_i\\rangle_{i<k}\\in Y\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall U,V,A\\\n\\left[\\left(\\forall\\langle B,K\\rangle\\in P\\ \\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\\n(A\\sigma=B\\tau\\Rightarrow (U\\sigma)^\\frown(K\\tau)^\\frown(V\\sigma)\\in N)\\right)\n\\Rightarrow U^\\frown\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in N\\right]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall U,V,A\\ (\\langle A\\rangle\\in Y\\Rightarrow U^\\frown\\langle-A\\rangle^\\frown V\\in N),\\\\\n\\mathcal C_P&:=\\{\\langle Y,N\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal G)^2:\\operatorname{ClNF}_P(Y,N)\\},\\\\\nY_P&:=\\bigcap\\{Y:\\exists N\\ \\langle Y,N\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_P\\},\\qquad\nN_P:=\\bigcap\\{N:\\exists Y\\ \\langle Y,N\\rangle\\in\\mathcal C_P\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G)","display":false}],"bytes":3025,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-re